n":["$","$L4",null,{"initialSaint":{"name":"हित हरिवंश   श्री राधा सुधा निधि  17","hinglishName":"hit harivnsh shri radha sudha nidhi 17","slug":"hit-harivnsh-shri-radha-sudha-nidhi-17","biography":"","metadata":null,"imageUrl":null,"verses":[{"id":"local-510","title":"वैदग्ध्य सिन्धु अनुराग","category":"Shloka","sanskrit_text":"“ वैदग्ध्य सिन्धु अनुराग-रसैक सिंधु, वात्सल्य सिंधु, अतिसान्ध्र कृपैक सिंधु ||लावण्य सिन्दु अमृतछवि रूप सिंधु, श्री राधिका स्फुरतु मे हृदय केलि सिंधु || ”","hindi_text":"“ वैदग्ध्य सिन्धु अनुराग-रसैक सिंधु, वात्सल्य सिंधु, अतिसान्ध्र कृपैक सिंधु ||\nलावण्य सिन्दु अमृतछवि रूप सिंधु, श्री राधिका स्फुरतु मे हृदय केलि सिंधु || ”\n- हित हरिवंश महाप्रभु - श्री राधा सुधा निधि - 17\nकला विलास की सिंधु, अनुराग रस की एक मात्र सिंधु, अतिशय ममत्व एवं वात्सल्य की सिंधु, अत्यंत प्रगाढ़ कृपा की सिंधु , अत्यंत मोहिनी एवं लावण्य सिंधु, अमृत छवि साक्षात् महाभाव स्वरुप सिंधु, अंतरंग केलि सिंधु स्वरूपा श्री राधा मेरे हृदय में प्रकट हों।","english_text":null,"english_translation":"\"Vaidagdhya Sindhu Anuraga-Rasaika-Sindhu\nVatsalya-Sindhu Ati-Sandra-Kripaika-Sindhu ||\nLavanya-Sindhu Amrta-Cchavi-Rupa-Sindhu\nShri-Radhika Sphurati Me Hrdi Keli-Sindhuh\"\n- Hita Harivansh Mahaprabhu - Shri Radha Sudha Nidhi - 17\nMay Shri Radha, who is an ocean of intelligence, a nectar ocean of love, an ocean of kind affection, an ocean of great mercy, an ocean of beauty, an ocean of nectar splendor, and an ocean of transcendental pastimes, appear in my heart.","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5a4f314659e8c72a534d86d8/vaidagdhya-sindhu-anuragarasaikasindhu-vatsalyasindhu-atisandrakripaikasindhu-lavanyasindhu-amrtacchavirupasindhu-shriradhika-sphurati-me-hrdi-kelisindhuh-hita-harivansh-mahaprabhu-shri-radha-sudha-nidhi-17","author":"हित हरिवंश महाप्रभु  श्री राधा सुधा निधि  17","status":"published","content_text":"“ वैदग्ध्य सिन्धु अनुराग-रसैक सिंधु, वात्सल्य सिंधु, अतिसान्ध्र कृपैक सिंधु ||\nलावण्य सिन्दु अमृतछवि रूप सिंधु, श्री राधिका स्फुरतु मे हृदय केलि सिंधु || ”\n- हित हरिवंश महाप्रभु - श्री राधा सुधा निधि - 17\nकला विलास की सिंधु, अनुराग रस की एक मात्र सिंधु, अतिशय ममत्व एवं वात्सल्य की सिंधु, अत्यंत प्रगाढ़ कृपा की सिंधु , अत्यंत मोहिनी एवं लावण्य सिंधु, अमृत छवि साक्षात् महाभाव स्वरुप सिंधु, अंतरंग केलि सिंधु स्वरूपा श्री राधा मेरे हृदय में प्रकट हों।","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5a4f314659e8c72a534d86d8/vaidagdhya-sindhu-anuragarasaikasindhu-vatsalyasindhu-atisandrakripaikasindhu-lavanyasindhu-amrtacchavirupasindhu-shriradhika-sphurati-me-hrdi-kelisindhuh-hita-harivansh-mahaprabhu-shri-radha-sudha-nidhi-17","slug":"vaidagdhy-sindhu-anuraga"}],"books":[],"rawItem":null}}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","saints","children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","saints","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/cbf73327883ccb7f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","1",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/fe995a1e4635138b.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","2",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/848f1edf91a8622f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en","className":"dark","children":["$","body",null,{"className":"antialiased","children":["$","$L8",null,{"children":["$","$L